&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:9pt;"&gt;当該株式の付与日以降、当該取締役が当社の取締役を退任する日までの期間。&lt;/p&gt;
